readme.text:
**Way A — auto-discovery (recommended)**: declare servers in `<harness home>/mcp-servers.json` (default `~/.dsh/mcp-servers.json`); they are auto-mounted at boot or on panel "Rescan":

```json
{
  "servers": {
    "filesystem": { "transport": "stdio", "command": "npx", "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem", "/tmp"] },
    "remote": { "transport": "streamable-http", "url": "https://your-mcp-server.example.com/mcp", "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer sk-xxx" } }
